; ----- en-GB (2057) -----
LangString K_ABORT 2057 "Are you sure you want to quit the Kiana Vnext Plus installer?"
LangString K_WELCOME_TITLE 2057 "Welcome to Kiana Vnext Plus"
LangString K_WELCOME_TEXT 2057 "This wizard will install Kiana Vnext Plus on your computer.$\r$\n$\r$\nPlease close all other programs before continuing.$\r$\n$\r$\nClick Next to continue."
LangString K_DIR_TOP 2057 "Choose the folder in which to install Kiana Vnext Plus."
LangString K_DIR_BOTTOM 2057 "To install in the default location, click Install. Click Browse to choose a different folder."
LangString K_FINISH_TITLE 2057 "Installation Complete"
LangString K_FINISH_TEXT 2057 "Kiana Vnext Plus has been installed.$\r$\n$\r$\nA shortcut has been placed on your desktop and in the Start menu.$\r$\n$\r$\nClick Finish to exit."
LangString K_RUN_LABEL 2057 "Launch Kiana now"
LangString K_SECTION_MAIN 2057 "Kiana Vnext Plus (required)"
LangString K_LNK_START 2057 "Kiana"
LangString K_LNK_UNINSTALL 2057 "Uninstall Kiana Vnext Plus"
LangString K_UNCONFIRM_TITLE 2057 "Uninstall Kiana Vnext Plus"
LangString K_UNCONFIRM_TEXT 2057 "This will remove Kiana Vnext Plus from your computer.$\r$\n$\r$\nThe uninstaller removes the application files and Start-menu shortcuts; your crawl data, cookies and settings are kept.$\r$\n$\r$\nClick Uninstall to continue."
LangString K_UNFINISH_TITLE 2057 "Uninstall Complete"
LangString K_UNFINISH_TEXT 2057 "Kiana Vnext Plus has been uninstalled.$\r$\n$\r$\nThank you for using Kiana."
LangString K_BRANDING 2057 "Kiana Labs"
LangString K_HEADER_FEATURES 2057 "Data collection engine"
LangString K_VERSION_NOTE 2057 "v2.17.1"

